OL,3,GNEWSAPlans unveiled for 83 new council
OL,4,Ahomes
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 80 new council homes are set
OL,7,Fto be built after Hull City Council
OL,8,Fsecured #9.2m in government funding.
OL,10,FThe money, awarded through the Social
OL,11,Fand Affordable Homes Programme (SAHP),
OL,12,Fwill support developments across six
OL,13,Fsites in the city.
OL,15,FThe latest grant of #6.6m will fund the
OL,16,Fconstruction of 51 homes at four sites,
OL,17,Fbuilding on an earlier award of #2.6m
OL,18,Ffor a further 32 properties.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
