OL,3,GNEWSAPlans unveiled for 83 new council
OL,4,Ahomes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the funding marked a
OL,7,Fsignificant step towards its target of
OL,8,Fdelivering 840 new council homes as
OL,9,Fpart of its housing growth plan.
